Package: erp-server-setup
Architecture: all
Depends: bash (>= 4.0), ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: sudo
Suggests: ufw, fail2ban, htop, git
Description: Automated professional server configuration and hardening
 This package provides an interactive bash script for automated configuration,
 security hardening, and monitoring setup on Linux servers.
 .
 Features:
  - Interactive menu-driven configuration
  - SSH security hardening
  - Firewall setup (UFW)
  - Fail2Ban protection
  - Password policy enforcement
  - Automatic security updates
  - Kernel hardening
  - Monitoring tools installation
  - Backup system configuration
  - Detailed logging and reporting
 .
 Supported distributions:
  - Ubuntu 18.04+
  - Debian 10+
  - CentOS 7+
  - RHEL 7+
  - Fedora 30+
